meta {
  name: List Subscription Requests
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/master/subscription-requests
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  X-Locale: {{locale}}
}

docs {
  # List Subscription Requests

  Every plan request of this account, newest first. The first item is the one
  to show on the plans screen: "waiting for approval" while `pending`, the
  `rejection_reason` once `rejected`.

  Same `ensure.client` gate as submitting, so it works for ordinary clients and
  for masters with expired access. Masters also get the waiting request as
  `pending_request` in `GET /api/v1/master/subscription`.

  **Response 200:**
  ```json
  {
    "data": [
      {
        "id": 42,
        "plan_id": 1,
        "plan_name": "1 месяц",
        "price": 1250,
        "duration_days": 30,
        "status": "rejected",
        "status_label": "Отклонена",
        "rejection_reason": "Оплата не поступила",
        "reviewed_at": "2026-10-09T15:30:00+05:00",
        "created_at": "2026-10-09T12:00:00+05:00"
      }
    ]
  }
  ```

  `plan_name`, `price`, `duration_days` are `null` if the plan was removed for good.

  **Errors:**
  - `401` — no token
  - `403` — token is not a client token
}
